@dsh-external/dsh-vision-skill README · dsh-vision-skill：**面向 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的多模态视觉感知与目标定位扩展**。

本插件将通用的多模态图像感知能力封装为 DSH 原生 Skill 插件。即使用户所用的主模型为纯文本大语言模型，也能通过本地混合处理流水线与多模态 VLM 工具链，实现全格式图像深度解析、长截图切片 OCR、界面 UI 控件目标检测（Grounding）与像素级坐标定位。

---

@dsh-external/dsh-vision-skill README · dsh-vision-skill：**Multimodal visual perception and target grounding extension for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).**

Wraps comprehensive multimodal computer vision capabilities into a native DSH Skill plugin. Even when operating with text-only foundation models, agents gain complete access to structured image comprehension, multi-pass OCR, UI element grounding, and pixel-precise bounding box detection through a hybrid on-device and VLM execution pipeline.

